title: Naresh_Day7
tags:
---

<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite SportsAcademy>>

// Scene Setup - Day 7 (Final Day)
With anticipation from yesterday's promise, Raju arrives as dusk settles, knowing this quiet period might offer the privacy needed for informal mentorship.

The academy grounds take on a sacred quality as evening settles. The empty facility represents both opportunity and danger - a chance for hands-on learning balanced against the threat of discovery.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Naresh" Mischievous>>
Naresh: Psst! Over here, beta.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Naresh" Excited>>
Naresh: The paying students are gone, Coach Sharma won't return until morning, and the administrative staff has left for the day.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" Quizzical>>
Raju: What is it, bhaiya? You seem... different today.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Naresh" Serious>>
Naresh: Five days of watching your dedication, your analytical approach, your genuine love for cricket...

<<SetCharacterExpression "Naresh" Anxious>>
Naresh: I've decided to do something I've never done before. Something that could cost me my job if anyone finds out.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Naresh" Excited>>
Naresh: I'm going to let you inside. Just for a short while.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Naresh" Smiling>>
Naresh: You can experience what real cricket equipment feels like, maybe practice a few shots in the nets.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Naresh" Worried>>
Naresh: But absolutely no one can ever know about this.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" Shocked>>
Raju: Really? You're... you're going to let me practice with professional equipment?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Naresh" Serious>>
Naresh: Don't make me regret this decision, boy.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Naresh" Anxious>>
Naresh: You've earned this chance through your dedication and respect. I'm trusting you with access that could destroy everything I've worked for here.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Naresh" Smiling>>
Naresh: This ball has seen better days, but it still has lessons to teach.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Naresh" Proud>>
Naresh: The weight, the feel, the way it moves through the air - these are things you can't learn from watching alone.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" Overjoyed>>
Raju: Thank you, bhaiya. I'll never forget this kindness.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" Determined>>
Raju: And I swear on my cricket dreams - no one will ever know I was here.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Naresh" Proud>>
Naresh: Go on then, scholar. Show me if all that watching and note-taking translated into real cricket understanding.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Naresh" Smiling>>
Naresh: You have thirty minutes to experience what professional cricket feels like.

<<HideCharacter>>
As Raju steps into the professional facility, he carries both extraordinary opportunity and responsibility. The moment represents persistence and respectful behavior transforming institutional barriers into genuine access.

